AWS EC2 Deployment Checklist:

1. Create AWS account
2. Launch t3.micro EC2
3. Download PEM key
4. SSH into EC2
5. Configure Security Group (22, 80, 443)
6. Install Node, Nginx
7. Clone project from GitHub
8. Run backend (PM2)
9. Configure Nginx reverse proxy
10. Map domain → EC2 IP
11. Restart Nginx
12. App live 
